Figures
-------
The figures in `assets/` are reproduced from the published article:

  M. Kavianpour, A. Ramezani, M. T. H. Beheshti,
  "A class alignment method based on graph convolution neural network for
  bearing fault diagnosis in presence of missing data and changing working
  conditions," Measurement 199 (2022) 111536.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.measurement.2022.111536

  (c) 2022 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.

They are included here solely to document and explain the authors' own work.
All rights in those figures remain with the copyright holder, and they are not
covered by the CC BY 4.0 license above.

Note: When code is added to this repository in the future, it will be released
under a separate software license stated at that time.
